---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Fees · Results, not fees | Life Story Wealth Planning';
const description = 'No management fee. I am paid only on gains above a high water mark and a quarterly 1.5% hurdle rate. If the strategy does not work in a given quarter, I do not get paid.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/fees">
  <main class="fees-page">
    <section class="fees-hero">
      <p class="fees-eyebrow">        <span>Chapter · Fees</span>      </p>
      <h1 class="fees-h1">Results, <em>not fees.</em></h1>
    </section>

    <section class="fees-hook" aria-labelledby="hook-h">
      <p class="fees-hook-q">So, what does this cost?</p>
      <p id="hook-h" class="fees-hook-a">Potentially nothing.</p>
      <p class="fees-hook-body">
        Most advisers charge a management fee. Whether your portfolio goes up, down, or
        sideways, the fee is charged. I do not. If the strategy I run for you does not work
        in a given quarter, if it does not exceed a defined threshold, I am not paid for
        that quarter. When it does exceed the threshold, I am paid a share of the excess gain.
        <strong>That is the whole model.</strong>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="fees-verbatim" aria-labelledby="verbatim-h">
      <p id="verbatim-h" class="fees-section-eyebrow">        <span>In my own words</span>
      </p>
      <p class="fees-section-note">
        The wording below is exactly as I publish it. It is the wording that governs the fee arrangement.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="fees-quote">
        <p>
          We charge no managements fees. We only make money by increasing your wealth.
          Performance success fees of 30% are assessed quarterly only on excess returns
          above a high water mark and a quarterly 1.5% hurdle rate.
        </p>
        <footer class="fees-quote-attr">
          Verbatim from the client agreement.
        </footer>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="fees-plain" aria-labelledby="plain-h">
      <h2 id="plain-h" class="fees-h2">What that means, <em>in plain language</em></h2>
      <p class="fees-plain-lede">Two things have to be true before I am paid anything.</p>

      <ol class="fees-conditions">
        <li class="app-reveal">
          <span class="fees-cond-num">01</span>
          <div class="fees-cond-body">
            <h3 class="fees-cond-h">Your account has to reach a new high.</h3>
            <p>
              This is the <em>high water mark</em>. If your portfolio drops and later recovers,
              no fee is charged on the recovered ground, the water mark is the previous peak.
              I am not paid twice on the same gains.
            </p>

            <figure class="fees-diagram" aria-labelledby="hwm-cap">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 400 190" class="fees-svg fees-svg-hwm" role="img" aria-labelledby="hwm-cap">
                <title id="hwm-cap">A stylised portfolio value line rises to a peak, dips, recovers back to the peak (no fee zone), then continues to a new high (fee zone).</title>

                {/* Baseline */}
                <line x1="20" y1="150" x2="380" y2="150" class="fees-svg-axis" />

                {/* Previous-peak dashed line */}
                <line x1="20" y1="75" x2="380" y2="75" class="fees-svg-peakline" />

                {/* No-fee recovery band (between valley and peak, up to x=270) */}
                <path class="fees-svg-nofee" d="M 100 75 L 270 75 L 270 115 C 220 130 180 130 165 115 C 145 100 130 90 100 75 Z" />

                {/* Fee zone above peak beyond x=270 */}
                <path class="fees-svg-feezone" d="M 270 75 L 380 75 L 380 40 L 270 40 Z" />

                {/* Portfolio value line */}
                <path class="fees-svg-line" d="M 20 130 C 55 100 80 80 100 75 C 130 90 145 100 165 115 C 190 130 235 120 270 75 C 305 55 350 45 380 40" />

                {/* Peak dot */}
                <circle cx="100" cy="75" r="4" class="fees-svg-dot" />
                {/* New-high dot */}
                <circle cx="380" cy="40" r="4" class="fees-svg-dot fees-svg-dot-brass" />

                {/* Labels */}
                <text x="105" y="66" class="fees-svg-label fees-svg-label-rubric">Previous peak</text>
                <text x="180" y="102" class="fees-svg-label">Returns to peak. No fee here.</text>
                <text x="376" y="60" class="fees-svg-label fees-svg-label-brass" text-anchor="end">New high. Fee only above.</text>
              </svg>
              <figcaption class="fees-diagram-caption">
                The line is your portfolio value over time. Recovery to the previous peak charges no fee. Only gains above the peak count.
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="app-reveal">
          <span class="fees-cond-num">02</span>
          <div class="fees-cond-body">
            <h3 class="fees-cond-h">The new high has to clear the hurdle, for that quarter.</h3>
            <p>
              This is the <em>hurdle rate</em>: 1.5% above the previous peak, per quarter.
              Small gains do not trigger a fee.
            </p>

            <figure class="fees-diagram" aria-labelledby="hurdle-cap">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 400 190" class="fees-svg fees-svg-hurdle" role="img" aria-labelledby="hurdle-cap">
                <title id="hurdle-cap">A stylised diagram showing two quarterly gains: one below the hurdle line (no fee), one above the hurdle where only the portion above the hurdle counts as fee.</title>

                {/* Baseline */}
                <line x1="20" y1="150" x2="380" y2="150" class="fees-svg-axis" />

                {/* Hurdle line */}
                <line x1="20" y1="85" x2="380" y2="85" class="fees-svg-hurdle-line" />
                <text x="376" y="98" class="fees-svg-label fees-svg-label-brass" text-anchor="end">Hurdle · 1.5%</text>

                {/* Bar A (below hurdle) */}
                <rect x="90" y="100" width="70" height="50" class="fees-svg-bar-quiet" />
                <text x="125" y="170" class="fees-svg-label" text-anchor="middle">Below hurdle</text>
                <text x="125" y="184" class="fees-svg-label fees-svg-label-faint" text-anchor="middle">No fee.</text>

                {/* Bar B (above hurdle: quiet base + rubric excess) */}
                <rect x="240" y="85" width="70" height="65" class="fees-svg-bar-quiet" />
                <rect x="240" y="45" width="70" height="40" class="fees-svg-bar-fee" />
                <text x="275" y="170" class="fees-svg-label" text-anchor="middle">Above hurdle</text>
                <text x="275" y="184" class="fees-svg-label fees-svg-label-rubric" text-anchor="middle">Fee on excess only.</text>

                {/* Brace around just the top slice, showing what the 30% is assessed on */}
                <path class="fees-svg-brace" d="M 316 45 C 322 45 322 52 328 52 C 322 52 322 58 316 58 M 316 85 C 322 85 322 78 328 78 C 322 78 322 72 316 72 M 328 52 L 328 78" />
                <text x="336" y="63" class="fees-svg-label fees-svg-label-rubric">30% of</text>
                <text x="336" y="76" class="fees-svg-label fees-svg-label-rubric">just this</text>
              </svg>
              <figcaption class="fees-diagram-caption">
                Two hypothetical quarterly outcomes. Below the hurdle: no fee at all. Above: the fee applies only to the slice above the hurdle line.
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <p class="fees-plain-close">
        When both conditions are met, the fee is 30% of the gains above the hurdle. Otherwise,
        there is no fee for that quarter.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="fees-why" aria-labelledby="why-h">
      <p class="fees-section-eyebrow">        <span>Why the model is built this way</span>
      </p>
      <p id="why-h" class="fees-why-body">
        I built it this way so my incentives line up with yours. If you do well, I do well.
        If you do not do well, I do not do well. That is how I want the arrangement to work,
        and it is a large part of why the firm exists.
      </p>
    </section>

    <aside class="fees-note" aria-labelledby="incentives-h">
      <p id="incentives-h" class="fees-note-label">A note on incentives</p>
      <p>
        A performance fee can, in theory, encourage an adviser to take more risk than they
        otherwise would, in the hope of triggering a fee. I am aware of it, and it is part
        of why my approach starts with risk management before anything else. The high water
        mark also helps: once a portfolio has fallen, I do not get paid on the recovery back
        to the previous peak, which removes any incentive to gamble the account back.
      </p>
    </aside>

    <aside class="fees-note fees-note-quiet" aria-labelledby="notshown-h">
      <p id="notshown-h" class="fees-note-label">What this page deliberately does not show</p>
      <p>
        No worked examples, comparison charts, or illustrations of what someone "would have
        paid" under this fee. Doing so would represent past or hypothetical performance, which
        sits under specific rules for advisers. If you want to understand how the structure
        would apply to your situation, we can walk through it in a conversation.
      </p>
    </aside>

    <div class="fees-cta">
      <p class="fees-cta-line">A page like this can only go so far. A first call takes it the rest of the way.</p>
      <a class="cta cta-large" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .fees-page {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 6rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem) clamp(4rem, 6vw, 8rem);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: [outer-l] 1fr [main] minmax(0, 720px) [outer-r] 1fr;
    row-gap: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4.5rem);
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
  }
  .fees-page > * { grid-column: main; }

  /* Hero */
  .fees-hero { text-align: center; }
  .fees-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
  }
  .fees-eyebrow-dash {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 28px;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .fees-h1 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 60;
  }
  .fees-h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .fees-lede {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.72);
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Hook, "Potentially nothing." as visual anchor */
  .fees-hook {
    text-align: center;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.14);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.14);
  }
  .fees-hook-q {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.6vw, 1.4rem);
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.55);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .fees-hook-a {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 50;
  }
  .fees-hook-body {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.82);
    max-width: 54ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .fees-hook-body strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink, #1c1712); }

  /* Verbatim wording, treated as legal citation */
  .fees-verbatim {}
  .fees-section-eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .fees-section-note {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.7);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .fees-quote {
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem) clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
    background: var(--paper-2, #f4ecdc);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    position: relative;
  }
  .fees-quote::before {
    content: '“';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.3rem;
    left: 0.75rem;
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.28);
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .fees-quote p {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .fees-quote-attr {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.55);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  /* Plain language, numbered conditions */
  .fees-h2 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.8vw, 2.4rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 120, 'SOFT' 40;
  }
  .fees-h2 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
  }
  .fees-plain-lede {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.78);
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }
  .fees-conditions {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }
  .fees-conditions li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .fees-cond-num {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
  }
  .fees-cond-h {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
  }
  .fees-cond-body p {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.82);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .fees-cond-body em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Pedagogical diagram beneath each condition */
  .fees-diagram {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem 1.15rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.12);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .fees-svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 460px;
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  .fees-svg-axis { stroke: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.35); stroke-width: 1; }
  .fees-svg-peakline,
  .fees-svg-hurdle-line {
    stroke: var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a);
    stroke-width: 1.25;
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
  }
  .fees-svg-brace {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    stroke-width: 1.25;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 500ms ease 1600ms;
  }
  .app-reveal.is-in .fees-svg-brace { opacity: 1; }
  .fees-svg-line {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    stroke-width: 1.75;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 900;
    stroke-dashoffset: 900;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 1400ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 250ms;
  }
  .app-reveal.is-in .fees-svg-line { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
  .fees-svg-nofee {
    fill: rgba(201, 161, 90, 0.14);
    stroke: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 700ms ease 1200ms;
  }
  .app-reveal.is-in .fees-svg-nofee { opacity: 1; }
  .fees-svg-feezone {
    fill: rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.16);
    stroke: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 700ms ease 1400ms;
  }
  .app-reveal.is-in .fees-svg-feezone { opacity: 1; }
  .fees-svg-dot {
    fill: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 500ms ease 1000ms;
  }
  .fees-svg-dot-brass { fill: var(--rubric, #8a3324); transition-delay: 1600ms; }
  .app-reveal.is-in .fees-svg-dot { opacity: 1; }
  .fees-svg-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    fill: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.7);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 500ms ease 1400ms;
  }
  .fees-svg-label-rubric { fill: var(--rubric, #8a3324); font-weight: 600; }
  .fees-svg-label-brass  { fill: color-mix(in oklab, var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a) 60%, var(--ink, #1c1712) 40%); font-weight: 600; }
  .fees-svg-label-faint  { fill: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.45); font-style: italic; }
  .app-reveal.is-in .fees-svg-label { opacity: 1; }

  /* Hurdle diagram bars */
  .fees-svg-bar-quiet {
    fill: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.18);
    opacity: 0;
    transform-origin: 50% 150px;
    transform: scaleY(0);
    transition: transform 700ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 300ms, opacity 400ms ease 300ms;
  }
  .fees-svg-bar-fee {
    fill: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    opacity: 0;
    transform-origin: 50% 85px;
    transform: scaleY(0);
    transition: transform 700ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 900ms, opacity 400ms ease 900ms;
  }
  .app-reveal.is-in .fees-svg-bar-quiet,
  .app-reveal.is-in .fees-svg-bar-fee {
    transform: scaleY(1);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .fees-diagram-caption {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.6);
    margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .fees-svg-line { stroke-dashoffset: 0; transition: none; }
    .fees-svg-nofee, .fees-svg-feezone, .fees-svg-dot, .fees-svg-label,
    .fees-svg-bar-quiet, .fees-svg-bar-fee {
      opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none;
    }
  }

  .fees-plain-close {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.05);
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.4);
  }

  /* Why */
  .fees-why-body {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  /* Notes, asides with quiet treatment */
  .fees-note {
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.14);
    border-left-width: 2px;
    border-left-color: rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.4);
  }
  .fees-note-label {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3 Variable', 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .fees-note p:not(.fees-note-label) {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.78);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .fees-note-quiet {
    border-left-color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.25);
  }
  .fees-note-quiet .fees-note-label { color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.55); }

  /* CTA */
  .fees-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }
  .fees-cta-line {
    font-family: 'Fraunces Variable', 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.8vw, 1.4rem);
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.72);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .fees-conditions li { grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .fees-cond-num { font-size: 1.75rem; }
    .fees-quote { padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; }
    .fees-quote::before { display: none; }
  }
</style>
